ONNX Runtime (Microsoft Corporation, MIT license,
https://onnxruntime.ai) is not part of this package or its binary. The
`ort` crate loads it at runtime; laya_install_runtime() downloads
Microsoft's official build from the NuGet package Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime,
which carries its own license and third-party notices.

